'''AeronautS''', created in may [[2016]], is the [[2on2]] team consisting of {{Player|bps|flag=se}} and {{Player|locust|flag=se}}, in preparations to the QuakeCon $25.000 2on2 tournament.

{{Flag/se}} bps and {{Flag/se}} locust have been rivals for ages. Their duels usually end up in smack talks, but they almost always ready up for another. 
In may 2016, dispite the rivalry, they joined ranks and formed AeronautS in preparations to the [[QuakeCon 2016]] $25.000 2on2 tournament.

